(:id "cs/F8" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cstable/fixed_strict_probes_test.go: TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict, TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl") :tested-revision "c4bc52d6b6c8b9306cb0f628206a2db987e26519" :note "2026-11-09: the strict read holds on the generated C# artifact: a ragged tail (rest not a whole number of records) is damage and the whole load is discarded; TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict asserts it, and TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl accepts the ragged tail in a copy of the real artifact and goes red.")
(:id "cs/F10" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cstable/fixed_strict_probes_test.go: TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict, TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl") :tested-revision "c4bc52d6b6c8b9306cb0f628206a2db987e26519" :note "2026-11-09: the strict read holds on the generated C# artifact: the read returns the count exactly once on success, -1 on every refusal, and resets the destination before a refused read (refuse writes nothing); TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict asserts it, and TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl makes a refusal return a count and goes red.")
(:id "cs/R8" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cstable/fixed_strict_probes_test.go: TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict, TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl") :tested-revision "c4bc52d6b6c8b9306cb0f628206a2db987e26519" :note "2026-11-09: the strict read holds on the generated C# artifact: a hash the lineage does not hold is layout_newer and reports THE FILE'S HASH and nothing else; TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict asserts it, and TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl makes layout_newer forget the hash and goes red.")
(:id "cs/R16" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cstable/fixed_strict_probes_test.go: TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict, TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl") :tested-revision "c4bc52d6b6c8b9306cb0f628206a2db987e26519" :note "2026-11-09: the strict read holds on the generated C# artifact: the report exposes only the surviving evolution counters (Unknown, Widened, Retained, RetainLost) — never a retired name (Malformed, KindMismatch, Clamped, Duplicate) — and a refusal moves no counter; TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict asserts it, and TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl republishes a retired name and goes red.")
(:id "cs/R29" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cstable/fixed_r29_strict_test.go: TestCSharpFixedR29Strict" "internal/codegen/cstable/fixed_r29_strict_test.go: TestCSharpFixedR29StrictNegativeControl") :note "2026-11-09: closed under the one read. The lineage entry's writer-bound pass holds the writer's own 0..100 and refuses out_of_range; it never clamps the value to the writer's end and the reader's wider 0..200 never accepts it on the compiled lane. A refusal resets values[0..k] and returns -1, so the read is the whole value or a refusal. The old TestFixedRoadmapCSharpT12PlansVersions/cs/R29 forged probe asserted the retired clamp-to-writer's-end answer (and simultaneously asserted the refusal was absent); it now asserts the strict refusal, the reset destination and the reader's own file reading whole. The negative control plants the pre-fix clamp, the dropped writer refusal and the dropped refusal reset in the real emitted artifact and requires the check to go red.")
(:id "cs/R30" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/cstable/fixed_strict_probes_test.go: TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict, TestCSharpFixedProbesStrictNegativeControl") :tested-revision "c4bc52d6b6c8b9306cb0f628206a2db987e26519" :note "2026-11-09: the strict read holds on the generated C# artifact: a NaN or infinity is refused by name (non_finite_float), lands nothing, and moves no counter; TestCSharpFixedProbesStrict asserts it on the compressed-float schema.")
